	quest.0653401A7B3A8EDC.quest_subtitle: "存储系统的基础。请求表必须与网络根相连，所有存储方块都需通过线缆连接到根。每个系统只能使用一个根。"
	quest.0653401A7B3A8EDC.title: "制作一个 &cStorage Network Root"
	quest.084BFF7D3DD9BB24.quest_desc: ["召唤者会用电闪、能量攻击和他的哥布林守卫作战。注意身后，这些哥布林若不加以防范，会迅速将你淹没。击败他即可进入自然地牢。"]
	quest.084BFF7D3DD9BB24.quest_subtitle: "使用钥匙传送到&5召唤者地牢&r。位于致盲地牢的顶部。"
	quest.084BFF7D3DD9BB24.title: "击败&5召唤者"
	quest.09919A0C03840EA7.quest_subtitle: "可装备在&e手腕栏位&r，以在屏幕上始终显示当前世界时间。"
	quest.09919A0C03840EA7.title: "制作一个 &6时钟"
	quest.0A99C7852725BFC2.quest_subtitle: "&eBronze Dungeons&r have entrances that are located on the sides of normal islands. Bronze dungeons can have a varying number of rooms. Non-boss rooms contain &c&lsentries&r&r which attack the player, and sometimes have chests on 4x4 tables. Some of these chests are &cMimics&r, however. The &9boss&r of this dungeon can't be attacked with a sword. He can, however, take damage from any tool (&apickaxe&r, &ashovel&r, etc.). &c9 blocks&r on the floor of each antechamber aren't minable at all. The &cboss room's&r walls are only minable once the &cboss&r is dead."
	quest.0BFD8ED8A0E3AE60.quest_subtitle: "将四个灵魂沙摆成“T”形，再放置3个凋零骷髅头，每个方块上各放一个。"
	quest.0BFD8ED8A0E3AE60.title: "击败&8&l凋零王（The Wither）"
	quest.0D129FBE9ED0D870.quest_subtitle: "使用 &a草绳 可以驯服"
	quest.0D129FBE9ED0D870.title: "观察一只 &f起重机"
	quest.0D8D493B7118A9BA.quest_subtitle: "点击&4龙&r将其与哨子绑定。使用哨子时，它会把你&4龙&r传送到你身边，即使跨越维度！你也可以按&bG&r，用背包里的哨子召唤你的&4龙&r。"
	quest.0D8D493B7118A9BA.title: "制作一个&9龙之哨子"
	quest.0DBCB8228E7CF7E1.quest_subtitle: "具有防止不死生物攻击的特殊效果。有15%的几率在废弃矿井中找到。"
	quest.0DBCB8228E7CF7E1.title: "获得一枚 &f幽灵龙蛋"
	quest.0E349CAEF1D249B6.quest_subtitle: "&bSliders&r 是一种在 &eBronze Dungeons&r 中找到的首领。"
	quest.0EDB1E145CB2D26F.quest_subtitle: "这里似乎还没有人。不过至少你可以用这些很酷的传送门。"
	quest.0EDB1E145CB2D26F.title: "前往&f&l最终城堡。"
	quest.0F4154714C10CACE.quest_subtitle: "赋予穿戴者永久性的&3速度效果"
	quest.0F4154714C10CACE.title: "合成 &3潜声者护腿"
	quest.100082345FA03A9B.quest_subtitle: "&cSentry&r 是 &4Bronze Dungeons&r 中的 &e敌对生物&r"
	quest.112944D3A2A1F3C0.quest_subtitle: "在&c下界&r中可防止敌人攻击，并为自己及附近的持有者提供火焰抗性。在堡垒中有35%的几率被发现。"
	quest.112944D3A2A1F3C0.title: "获得一枚&6下界龙之卵"
	quest.119D3352DF35D3F3.quest_subtitle: "用于创造&a花匠&r村民，他们会出售蜂蜜块和指向沼泽与丛林的地图。"
	quest.119D3352DF35D3F3.title: "制作一张&f园艺台"
	quest.123097813B579C3E.quest_subtitle: "功能和 &3Storage Terminal&7 一样，但自带合成网格。"
	quest.123097813B579C3E.title: "制作一个 &6合成终端机 (Crafting Terminal)"
	quest.139DAA6E8CF4267A.quest_desc: [
